{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pallets/click/issues/3652","id":4771260298,"node_id":"I_kwDOASN_zM8AAAABHGOnig","number":3652,"title":"Automatically append ellipsis (`...`) to metavars when `multiple=True` in options","user":{"login":"iynehz","id":20906652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTA2NjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20906652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz","html_url":"https://github.com/iynehz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iynehz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2202111823,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjAyMTExODIz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/labels/help%20output","name":"help output","color":"e8a44a","default":false,"description":"Help text formatting, layout, and --help rendering","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-29T20:09:14Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T02:56:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When building a command-line interface with `click.option(..., multiple=True)`, the auto-generated usage string does not visually signal to the user that the option can be repeated. For instance, an option --foo=FOO looks identical whether it accepts single or multiple arguments. This is different from the common convention for multi-value items in shell interfaces often suggests adding an ellipsis like `--foo=FOO...`\n\nExpected behavior if option \"foo\" has `multiple=True`:\n```\nUsage: script.py [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n  --foo TEXT...  A list of foo strings.\n  --help         Show this message and exit.\n```\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}